# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Single .gitignore for the whole repository: .NET host, modules/** and both
# Angular workspaces.
#
# Do NOT add per-project .gitignore files. Unlike .editorconfig there is no
# "root" switch here: these patterns already apply to every subdirectory, and a
# nested file would only ADD rules. ABP and the Angular CLI scaffold their own
# copies into new modules — delete them.
#
# Angular patterns below are intentionally UNANCHORED (dist/ not /dist) so they
# match inside angular/ and modules/<Name>/angular/ rather than only at the
# repo root.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ══════════════════════════ Secrets ══════════════════════════
# ABP loads these via AddAppSettingsSecretsJson(). Never commit them.
appsettings.secrets.json

