# ══════════════════════════ ABP ══════════════════════════════
**/.abpstudio/
**/*.abppkg.analyze.json

# Cursor rules generated by ABP, at the root and inside every new module. Redundant:
# their content already lives in .claude/rules/, which is the maintained copy. ABP keeps
# recreating them, so ignore rather than delete — deleting is a fight you lose every time
# you scaffold a module. Unanchored, so it catches modules/<Name>/.cursor/ too.
.cursor/

# Use abp install-libs to restore.
**/wwwroot/libs/*

# IdentityServer temp files
tempkey.rsa
tempkey.jwk

# ABP Suite
.suite/

# ═════════════════════ Angular / Node ════════════════════════
# Unanchored on purpose — these must match angular/ and
# modules/<Name>/angular/, not just the repo root.
node_modules/
dist/
tmp/
out-tsc/
bazel-out/
typings/
coverage/
.angular/
connect.lock
chrome-profiler-events*.json
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
testem.log

# ═══════════════════ Editors / IDE (cross-stack) ═════════════
.project
.classpath
.c9/
*.launch
.settings/
*.sublime-workspace
.history/
# Unanchored: a middle separator would pin this to the repo root, missing
# angular/.vscode/ and modules/<Name>/angular/.vscode/ (both Angular CLI scaffolding).
# Excludes CONTENTS, not the directory — git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, which would kill the negations below.
**/.vscode/*
# Shared editor config is committable at the ROOT only (leading /). Nested .vscode
# dirs are generated per workspace and duplicated; root covers both workspaces.
!/.vscode/settings.json
!/.vscode/tasks.json
!/.vscode/launch.json
!/.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

# ═══════════════════════ OS artifacts ════════════════════════
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ═════════════════════ MyMechanicShop ════════════════════════
# Local SQLite databases. One per module (MyMechanicShop.db, MyMechanicShopCatalog.db,
# …) — all rebuilt from scratch by src/MyMechanicShop.DbMigrator, so they are local
# environment state, not source.
MyMechanicShop*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Claude Code — personal configurations
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
